<% set_page_meta title: "README", description: "About SPEERD and the practice connecting light, costume, code, and metal." %>

<main id="main-content">
  <header class="page-hero about-hero accent--electric">
    <div class="page-hero__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">About the maker</p>
      <h1>README</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__lede">SPEERD is a workshop practice for objects that sit between engineering, craft, and performance. The shop it comes out of is the Chaos Factory.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-hero__code" aria-hidden="true">
      <% [ "01 / IMAGINE", "02 / PROTOTYPE", "03 / BREAK", "04 / BUILD BETTER" ].each_with_index do |stage, index| %>
        <span class="<%= spectrum_class(index) %>"><%= stage %></span>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="about-grid" aria-labelledby="about-practice-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">The practice</p>
      <h2 id="about-practice-title">Different materials. Same curiosity.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I build responsive LED art, overcommitted costumes, and wearable metalwork in a shop called the Chaos Factory. The disciplines look unrelated until the workbench fills up: each needs a feel for systems, materials, human movement, and the precise moment when restraint stops being useful.</p>
      <p>This site is a living record of finished pieces and the decisions behind them. The project pages tell the story; the galleries hold the close looks, strange details, and proof that the thing really worked.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="principles" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Workshop notes</p>
    <h2 id="principles-title">A few things I believe.</h2>
    <ol>
      <% [
        "The engineering should serve the experience.",
        "A prop is not finished until a person can live in it.",
        "Serviceability is a design feature.",
        "There is always room for one more light."
      ].each_with_index do |principle, index| %>
        <li><span class="<%= spectrum_class(index) %>"><%= format("%02d", index + 1) %></span> <%= principle %></li>
      <% end %>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <%= render "shared/contact_cta" %>
</main>
